msgid ""
"The change takes effect within a couple of seconds; no restart of the "
"extension or the Mac is required. It is recommended to restore the default "
"value by deleting the explicit value after you have resolved the problem you"
" were investigating:"
msgstr ""
"Ændringen træder i kraft inden for få sekunder; du behøver ikke at genstarte"
" udvidelsen eller din Mac. Det anbefales at gendanne standardværdien ved at "
"slette den udtrykkelige værdi, når du har løst det problem, du undersøgte:"
